<!doctype html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title><%= title %></title><link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    body{font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;background:#0a0f1a;color:#e2e8f0;margin:0}.topbar{background:rgba(15,23,42,0.8);border-bottom:1px solid rgba(148,163,184,0.1);backdrop-filter:blur(20px);padding:0 2rem;height:64px;display:flex;align-items:center;position:sticky;top:0;z-index:100}.topbar-inner{width:100%;max-width:1400px;margin:0 auto;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}.logo{font-size:1.25rem;font-weight:700;color:#e2e8f0;text-decoration:none}.logo-icon{color:#60a5fa}.topbar-nav{display:flex;gap:0.25rem;align-items:center}.topbar-nav a{color:#94a3b8;padding:0.5rem 0.75rem;border-radius:6px;text-decoration:none;font-size:0.875rem;font-weight:500;transition:all 0.15s}.topbar-nav a:hover,.topbar-nav a.active{color:#e2e8f0;background:rgba(148,163,184,0.1)}.session-pill{padding:0.42rem 0.78rem;border:1px solid rgba(148,163,184,0.18);border-radius:999px;color:#e2e8f0;font-size:0.82rem}.btn-logout{background:transparent;color:#f87171;border:1px solid rgba(248,113,113,0.25);font-family:inherit;cursor:pointer}.btn-secondary{background:rgba(148,163,184,0.12);color:#e2e8f0;border:1px solid rgba(148,163,184,0.18);text-decoration:none;font-weight:500}.btn-secondary:hover{background:rgba(148,163,184,0.2)}.btn-primary{background:#2563eb;color:#fff;border:none;padding:0.6rem 1.2rem;border-radius:8px;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;font-family:inherit;font-size:0.875rem}.btn-primary:hover{background:#1d4ed8}.alert{padding:1rem 1.25rem;border-radius:10px;font-size:0.9rem;margin-bottom:1.5rem}.alert-success{background:rgba(34,197,94,0.1);border:1px solid rgba(74,222,128,0.22);color:#86efac}.alert-error{background:rgba(239,68,68,0.1);border:1px solid rgba(248,113,113,0.24);color:#fca5a5}.alert-info{background:rgba(59,130,246,0.1);border:1px solid rgba(96,165,250,0.2);color:#93c5fd}.hint{color:#94a3b8;font-size:0.85rem;margin-top:0.5rem}.main-content{max-width:900px;margin:0 auto;padding:2rem}.card{background:rgba(30,41,59,0.6);border:1px solid rgba(148,163,184,0.1);border-radius:12px;padding:1.75rem;margin-bottom:1.5rem}.card h2{font-size:1.25rem;font-weight:700;color:#f8fafc;margin-bottom:1rem}.card h3{font-size:1rem;font-weight:600;color:#e2e8f0;margin-bottom:0.75rem}.drop-zone{border:2px dashed rgba(148,163,184,0.25);border-radius:12px;padding:2.5rem 1.5rem;text-align:center;cursor:pointer;transition:all 0.2s;margin-bottom:1.5rem;background:rgba(15,23,42,0.3)}.drop-zone:hover,.drop-zone.dragover{border-color:#60a5fa;background:rgba(59,130,246,0.05)}.drop-zone-icon{font-size:2.5rem;color:#60a5fa;margin-bottom:0.75rem}.drop-zone-text{color:#cbd5e1;font-size:0.95rem}.drop-zone-hint{color:#64748b;font-size:0.8rem;margin-top:0.5rem}.file-input{display:none}.file-name{color:#93c5fd;font-size:0.9rem;margin-bottom:1rem}.info-list{list-style:none;padding:0}.info-list li{padding:0.4rem 0;color:#cbd5e1;font-size:0.875rem}.info-list li::before{content:'•';color:#60a5fa;margin-right:0.5rem}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header class="topbar">
    <div class="topbar-inner">
      <a href="/" class="logo"><span class="logo-icon">◆</span> Artigos LIGEM</a>
      <nav class="topbar-nav">
        <a href="/admin">Dashboard</a>
        <a href="/admin/events" class="active">Eventos</a>
        <a href="/admin/users">Usuários</a>
        <% if (userEmail) { %><span class="session-pill"><%= userEmail %></span><% } %>
        <form method="POST" action="/admin/logout" style="display:inline"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><button type="submit" class="btn btn-logout">Sair</button></form>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </header>
  <main class="main-content">
    <h1 style="font-size:1.75rem;font-weight:700;color:#f8fafc;margin-bottom:0.25rem">Importar Usuários do Even3</h1>
    <p style="color:#94a3b8;margin-bottom:1.5rem">Importe usuários a partir de uma planilha exportada pelo Even3. O CPF é usado como chave principal; se não houver CPF, o passaporte é usado; caso nenhum dos dois exista, o e-mail é utilizado como chave. Informações complementares serão atualizadas se diferirem dos dados atuais.</p>

    <% if (success) { %><div class="alert alert-success"><%= success %></div><% } %>
    <% if (error) { %><div class="alert alert-error"><%= error %></div><% } %>

    <div class="card">
      <h2>Como obter a planilha no Even3</h2>
      <ol class="info-list">
        <li>Acesse <strong>www.even3.com.br</strong> e entre no painel do evento.</li>
        <li>No menu lateral, vá em <strong>Pessoas</strong> → <strong>Ações</strong> → <strong>Exportar geral</strong>.</li>
        <li>Baixe o arquivo em formato <strong>Excel (.xlsx)</strong>.</li>
        <li>Envie a planilha abaixo para importar os usuários.</li>
      </ol>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <h2>Upload da planilha</h2>
      <p class="hint" style="margin-bottom:1rem">O sistema procura automaticamente as colunas <strong>Nome</strong>, <strong>E-mail</strong>, <strong>Organização/Instituição</strong>, <strong>Telefone</strong> e <strong>CPF</strong>. Apenas o e-mail é obrigatório; sem ele, a linha é ignorada.</p>
      <form method="POST" enctype="multipart/form-data" action="/admin/events/<%= event.id %>/import-users" id="import-form">
        <input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>">
        <div class="drop-zone" id="drop-zone">
          <div class="drop-zone-icon">📄</div>
          <div class="drop-zone-text" id="drop-zone-text">Arraste a planilha aqui ou <strong>clique para selecionar</strong></div>
          <div class="drop-zone-hint">Arquivos .xlsx, .xls ou .csv exportados pelo Even3</div>
          <input type="file" name="import_file" class="file-input" id="file-input" accept=".xlsx,.xls,.csv" required>
        </div>
        <div class="file-name" id="file-name" style="display:none"></div>
        <button type="submit" class="btn-primary">Importar usuários</button>
      </form>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <h2>O que acontece na importação</h2>
      <ul class="info-list">
        <li><strong>Cria novo usuário</strong> — quando CPF, passaporte e e-mail não existem no sistema, um usuário é criado com a informação disponível e uma senha temporária.</li>
        <li><strong>Atualiza dados complementares</strong> — quando CPF (ou passaporte, ou e-mail) já existe, nome, instituição, telefone e e-mail são atualizados se diferirem dos dados atuais.</li>
        <li><strong>Ignora duplicatas</strong> — linhas sem CPF, passaporte e e-mail são ignoradas.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </main>
  <%- include("../../partials/csrf-inject") %>
  <script>
    const dropZone=document.getElementById('drop-zone');
    const fileInput=document.getElementById('file-input');
    const fileNameEl=document.getElementById('file-name');
    const dropText=document.getElementById('drop-zone-text');
    dropZone.addEventListener('click',()=>fileInput.click());
    dropZone.addEventListener('dragover',(e)=>{e.preventDefault();dropZone.classList.add('dragover')});
    dropZone.addEventListener('dragleave',()=>dropZone.classList.remove('dragover'));
    dropZone.addEventListener('drop',(e)=>{e.preventDefault();dropZone.classList.remove('dragover');if(e.dataTransfer.files.length){fileInput.files=e.dataTransfer.files;handleFile(e.dataTransfer.files[0])}});
    fileInput.addEventListener('change',()=>{if(fileInput.files.length)handleFile(fileInput.files[0])});
    function handleFile(file){fileNameEl.textContent='Arquivo selecionado: '+file.name;fileNameEl.style.display='block';dropText.innerHTML='Arquivo selecionado: <strong>'+file.name+'</strong>'}
  </script>
</body>
</html>
